    "norm": "Verifies that {@link DiscordianDate#of(int, int, int)} rejects field values that fall outside the Discordian calendar's valid ranges. <p> In the Discordian calendar a normal year has 5 months (1..5), each with 73 days (1..73). The only legal use of month 0 / day 0 is St. Tib's Day, which exists solely in leap years; 1900 is not a leap year, so even {@code (1900, 0, 0)} is invalid here."
